      "Title": "MewExtendedToolkit.TransformBox",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/MewExtendedToolkit.TransformBox.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Decorator that applies a composed Matrix3x2 transform before rendering the child.\nTransform order: Translate(-origin) → Scale → Rotate → Translate(+origin + offset).\nOrigin is relative (0.0–1.0) to the content bounds; defaults to center (0.5, 0.5).</p>\n"
